Subject: wifi: ath11k: add BE7000 native radio support for backports 7.2

Adapted from kravasuper/openwrt 790d036a178c0f695c2f60d490d194091b35e595.
The IPQ9574 support originates with Alexandru Gagniuc and Igor Kravchenko.
Adapted for backports 7.2 and the BE7000 native WLAN profile by
Nickolai Semendiaev <agent00791@gmail.com>.

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/qmi.c b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/qmi.c
index 623ad54..06468ff 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/qmi.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/qmi.c
@@ -1756,7 +1756,8 @@ int ath11k_qmi_host_cap_send(struct ath11k_base *ab)
 	if (ab->hw_params.global_reset)
 		req.nm_modem |= PLATFORM_CAP_PCIE_GLOBAL_RESET;
 
-	req.nm_modem |= PLATFORM_CAP_PCIE_PME_D3COLD;
+	if (ab->hw_rev != ATH11K_HW_IPQ9574)
+		req.nm_modem |= PLATFORM_CAP_PCIE_PME_D3COLD;
 
 	ath11k_dbg(ab, ATH11K_DBG_QMI, "host cap request\n");
 
